OL,3,ADense fog threatens Monday morning
OL,4,Arush-hour disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisibility could fall to less than 50m
OL,7,Fin places, making driving difficult.
OL,8,FBus, train, ferry and flight services
OL,9,Fcould also face delays or
OL,10,Fcancellations.
OL,12,FThe fog will gradually lift through
OL,13,FMonday morning, although some patches
OL,14,Fcould linger into the afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
