OL,3,AGovernment's EV targets expected to be
OL,4,Areduced this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the speed of the transition to
OL,7,Felectric has been hotly debated,
OL,8,Fincluding within the cabinet.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
