OL,3,ASeven dead and more than 100 injured
OL,4,Aafter trains collide in Egypt
OL,5,
OL,6,FEgyptian President Abdul Fattah al-Sisi
OL,7,Fsaid he had ordered state authorities
OL,8,Fto "investigate the circumstances of
OL,9,Fthe accident, and hold accountable
OL,10,Fanyone found to have been negligent".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
